# Build context filter (SPEC deployment hygiene).
#
# Without this file the root context ships the local virtualenv, downloaded public
# datasets, the object store, model weights and every report to the daemon on each
# build: slow transfers, and credentials/data leaking into intermediate layers.

# --- VCS / editor -----------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.github
.idea
.vscode

# --- Python environments / caches -------------------------------------------
.venv
venv
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
*.egg-info
build
dist

# --- Local runtime state ----------------------------------------------------
var
.tmp
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Data, fixtures, datasets and model weights -----------------------------
# Fixtures are generated inside the image/test run, never baked in.
fixtures
public-data
data
artifacts
reports
acceptance
benchmarks
*.parquet
*.mp4
*.mcap
*.tar.gz
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.engine

# --- Docs / specification bundles (not needed at runtime) -------------------
docs
*.pdf
Embodied_DataOps_V2_增量规格包
Embodied_DataOps_V2.1_正式规格包

# --- Tests are run from the source tree, not from an image ------------------
tests
